    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Return;</h2><br><strong>&quot;Solve or Die&quot;</strong><br>Escape Space Station, Puzzle, Shooting VR Game.<br>Defeat aliens and solve puzzles to escape to Earth in a contaminated space station!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2>You can select a button in the play screen by pressing the trigger button on the VR controller.<br>You can check the operation method by pressing the A button on the VR controller.<br><br><strong>Introduce Developers</strong><br>Yeni, TG Lee, Seyoung Yang<br>This VR game was created by three friends using UnrealEngine5 for about 7 weeks.<br>We hope you enjoy playing our game!<br><br><strong>Language Selection</strong><br>We have 2 options : English, Korean<br>At the beginning of the game, press &quot;Settings&quot; and select language you want.<br>Go back to main page, and Enjoy our game!<br>If there's a problem with language settings let us know! Leave the message at the community!",
